{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10131210","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10131210","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:0:1013121001:0":{"text":"へぇ……アンタたちは魔像の痕跡を追ってここまで来たのか。","source_cn":"唔……原来你们是追查魔偶踪迹来到这里的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F4CE5089D430201","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1013121002:0":{"text":"もっと早く来てくれたらなぁ、みんなも故郷を捨てなくてすんだのに……","source_cn":"你们要是早点来就好了，大伙就不至于背井离乡了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9436C1FF509F482F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1013121003:0":{"text":"メリス殿、この辺りでは以前から魔像の被害が？","source_cn":"梅瑞特小姐，魔偶在附近作乱很久了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0E0E483A0D7AECE7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1013121004:0":{"text":"いや、以前は遠くの山から魔像が下りてきたって話を聞くぐらいだよ。実際に姿を見かけるようになったのはほんの最近だ。","source_cn":"先前只是听村里的人说远处的山上有魔偶下来，真正见到它们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x623D782FFA473469","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:梅瑞特":{"text":"メリス","source":"梅瑞特","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:特弥希娅":{"text":"テミシア","source":"特弥希娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}